            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you check if https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/83047\n\nfixes the issue?\n\nentity-manager should listen to `InterfacesAdded`/`InterfacesRemoved` for the interfaces in probes on.\n\nSo it should not matter if some DBus interfaces are not yet created, since entity-manager should receive the signal when they get created."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Bruce Hung",
                        "email": "bruce.jy.hung@fii-foxconn.com",
                        "username": "FXN-Bruce"
                    },
                    "message": "We have checked #83047 and tested on our platform. The root causes are the same and it does fixes the issue, hence withdrawed this commit. Thank you @alexander.hansen@9elements.com."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 510,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "EM does not only depend on `fru-device`. It can probe on any DBus interface.\n\nSo we cannot return from this golden callback just because fru device is not ready.\n\nAnd `fru-device` is an optional component due to meson option."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 510,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "the function is only ever called with same arguments, so we do not need to pass these numbers and can simply hardcode them in the function itself, right?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 510,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Would this be the right place to put it?\n\nBased on your commit message, this is more of an initialization logic."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 510,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "agree, IBM uses EM but not fru-device."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.cpp",
                    "line": 694,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
